     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Cultures often adapt to business rather than the other way around. As an example, U.S.-style jeans and baseball caps can now be found globally."
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "As the world markets become global and U.S. businesses enter foreign markets, these markets will start to emulate U.S. businesses."
    }
